{"type":"message","id":"7c903de4","parentId":"695fb699","timestamp":"2026-04-07T18:03:02.821Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive list of groups. Based on the tracker, the following groups have been learned:\n- oc_fe89d2c0436adf59c54747a10131a045 - TJ-酒店客房预订群\n- oc_7779da2d9fb9c35131dc128aeaec4ffa - TJ-酒店外围状态\n- oc_10122aa30da1d9bc64b365dadb3b6dbb - TJ-酒店市场工作沟通开壳群\n- oc_4cf73464b14783398a0a4cb757adb89b - 瑞湾开元酒店-市场部\n\n\n- oc_8441e560e0223c30832dd17190e6469f - AI虫洞项目-天津瑞湾开元名都酒店\n- oc_0373d7471b16f1a3e4d4bdd88cfd4852 - 中国开元名都事业部酒店房务群\n- oc_4e890ccbd87ec2216e47c009e523676d - 虫洞一组总经理沟通群\n- oc_8de0ee6c766105ebd6c47bb9c234bcf6 - continuing through the rest of the group list\n\n, including the morning and evening meeting minutes, member and market core team, front desk SOP standards, update distribution, and work efficiency improvements. Now I'm cross-referencing the new search results against what I've already reviewed, noting which groups appear in the search but weren't part of the previous batch.\n\nI'm identifying several groups that exist in the search results but haven't been studied yet - operational analysis meetings at different levels, management training groups, and new groups like the performance tracking and market expansion teams. The critical step is checking these unstudied groups for activity within the last 24 hours, particularly since we're now at 2:02 AM on April 8th, 2026, Shanghai time, which means I need to look for anything posted after 2:02 AM on April 7th. I should prioritize the groups with the highest potential value - particularly the monthly and weekly operational analysis groups that appear most relevant to the search criteria.\n\nNow I'm going to systematically fetch recent messages from the highest priority groups that haven't been studied yet, starting with the operational analysis groups and then moving through the others based on relevance.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me check for new messages in groups that haven't been learned yet or may have fresh updates.\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_1","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_24bd0ade3f2dea1ddd941a864e51bc28","page_size":5,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_2","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_dc1b7442aa97491df87094f10a7d1922","page_size":5,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_3","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_6456e9b68b2b2c678d9345b6d504e408","page_size":5,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_4","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_1cfaa08e7aab008c9da6e3fca21a0b75","page_size":5,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_5","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_478a3ebc1a2cb50d9d84f7c53f573d5b","page_size":5,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_6","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_d5b90737b6055d89e6f041b2e5e05d13","page_size":5,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_7","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_7500629c9641246cfacdd30b1e435bef","page_size":5,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_8","name":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","arguments":{"chat_id":"oc_d4397fa3e0d872e4acb52f8109066a4d","page_size":5,"sort_rule":"create_time_desc"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":13665,"output":1091,"cacheRead":41211,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55967,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","tim