{"type":"message","id":"52e67627","parentId":"9daba2e7","timestamp":"2026-04-07T18:03:03.255Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_2","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbb09b819cfbc0f37a52b979d87e\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@晁留柱 晁总 客房板块 长住团出现了持续产量减少 酒店出租率下滑很明显\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_b44c6cc3725fecd42af0d2a7f76a0af3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"丁立锋\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2024-11-25T10:22:37+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n          \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbb09bbd849b80f44c1238cfd4f6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_02gv_8b581b3f-c6c7-4a9a-a4e3-5e8ef39bcccg)\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_b44c6cc3725fecd42af0d2a7f76a0af3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"丁立锋\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2024-11-25T10:22:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbcd98b2b36980f1d7086df308c4\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_02gr_772522e6-0a6d-4189-b276-8bb05cbcda3g)\\n丁总您好，酒店截止8月产生约35万会员发展相关物料和差费费用，预计2025年不再开展大规模的会员外拓，但店内精准会员还是要坚持，预计费用较大幅下降。 另外，百达卡划转费用实际产生了57万。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2024-11-21T15:08:14+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbcd966da97dc0f311935d2ce1fd\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"2024年 会员异地开拓 投入了多少费用？\\n\\n2024年 百达卡消费费用划转了多少费用？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_b44c6cc3725fecd42af0d2a7f76a0af3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"丁立锋\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2024-11-21T14:26:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbcd95fbffa340ec47073a7d9f87\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"丁总您好，因为酒店今年落实房间的翻新改造投入，则后续截止项目结束2027年，每年增加30万左右的分摊，加上年度折旧57万，则盈亏平衡至少EBITDA应达100万左右，减掉这些分摊预计产生税前利润10万。 加外，GOP同比增加300万，主要是预测考虑：\\n1、一方面营收增加135万；\\n2、另外，从成本费用的管控方面，由于现在边防长住团队的产量从90间左右下滑至60-70间，则预计房间含餐成本同比减少73万，这部分下滑间夜我们需要通过其他市场渠道做增量补充进来；\\n3、物料消耗预计同比减少35万；（2024年初尝试会员异地外拓，产生一定的会员物料消耗）\\n4、市场营销费预计同比减少57万；（2024年百达卡销售划转费用较高，接下来划转预计大幅减少）；\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2024-11-21T14:20:07+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMLt26-aTu4HeXkJxeYYDp7OlXsq0n4mjM3uoh5C1RjYPBuhE30VNs3xN64gS9QHQKkUtr84eyL33VTeVB1hglxaENUzlaMKGMeynafGm3bEr\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100bbb09b819cfbc0f37a52b979d87e","msg_type":"text","content":"@晁留柱 晁总 客房板块 长住团出现了持续产量减少 酒店出租率下滑很明显","sender":{"id":"ou_b44c6cc3725fecd42af0d2a7f76a0af3","sender_type":"user","name":"丁立锋"},"create_time":"2024-11-25T10:22:37+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","name":"晁留柱"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100bbb09bbd849b80f44c1238cfd4f6","msg_type":"image","content":"![image](img_v3_02gv_8b581b3f-c6c7-4a9a-a4e3-5e8ef39bcccg)","sender":{"id":"ou_b44c6cc3725fecd42af0d2a7f76a0af3","sender_type":"user","name":"丁立锋"},"create_time":"2024-11-25T10:22:09+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100bbcd98b2b36980f1d7086df308c4","msg_type":"post","content":"![image](img_v3_02gr_772522e6-0a6d-4189-b276-8bb05cbcda3g)\n丁总您好，酒店截止8月产生约35万会员发展相关物料和差费费用，预计2025年不再开展大规模的会员外拓，但店内精准会员还是要坚持，预计费用较大幅下降。 另外，百达卡划转费用实际产生了57万。","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2024-11-21T15:08:14+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100bbcd966da97dc0f311935d2ce1fd","msg_type":"text","content":"2024年 会员异地开拓 投入了多少费用？\n\n2024年 百达卡消费费用划转了多少费用？","sender":{"id":"ou_b44c6cc3725fecd42af0d2a7f76a0af3","sender_type":"user","name":"丁立锋"},"create_time":"2024-11-21T14:26:09+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100bbcd95fbffa340ec47073a7d9f87","msg_type":"text","content":"丁总您好，因为酒店今年落实房间的翻新改造投入，则后续截止项目结束2027年，每年增加30万左右的分摊，加上年度折旧57万，则盈亏平衡至少EBITDA应达100万左右，减掉这些分摊预计产生税前利润10万。 加外，GOP同比增加300万，主要是预测考虑：\n1、一方面营收增加135万；\n2、另外，从成本费用的管控方面，由于现在边防长住团队的产量从90间左右下滑至60-70间，则预计房间含餐成本同比减少73万，这部分下滑间夜我们需要通过其他市场渠道做增量补充进来；\n3、物料消耗预计同比减少35万；（2024年初尝试会员异地外拓，产生一定的会员物料消耗）\n4、市场营销费预计同比减少57万；（2024年百达卡销售划转费用较高，接下来划转预计大幅减少）；","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2024-11-21T14:20:07+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMLt26-aTu4HeXkJxeYYDp7OlXsq0n4mjM3uoh5C1RjYPBuhE30VNs3xN64gS9QHQKkUtr84eyL33VTeVB1hglxaENUzlaMKGMeynafGm3bEr"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775584983254}}
