lmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMLt26-aTu4HeXkJxeYYDp7PFNp3oi8FZFuApcoxGJLyk0PRVTz039GkMCFPx5LSxpmBU1x-9nAGfrPcB4Z5JfRD9nzo9DfJzRTHQkCCR-aKh"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775584983340}}
{"type":"message","id":"cc4487af","parentId":"811d25cd","timestamp":"2026-04-07T18:03:03.343Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_142mg999bhhv_4","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523223c0e4a0c2b91922dee0f28\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card>\\n✅ **已完成！DeerFlow 2.0开发规划已列入！**---##### 📋 已列入的4大发展方向\\n| 方向 | 优先级 | 核心目标 | 预计时间 |\\n|------|------|------|------|\\n| 1️⃣ 自动化 | 🔴 最高 | 每周五自动获取最新预测数据 | 1-2周 |\\n| 2️⃣ 智能化 | 🟡 高 | 基于历史数据训练预测模型 | 3-4周 |\\n| 3️⃣ 协作化 | 🟢 中 | 多AI角色分工协作 | 4-6周 |\\n| 4️⃣ 产品化 | 🔵 长期 | 固化为AI Native产品，推广到32家酒店 | 8-12周 |\\n|  |  |  |  |---##### ✅ 已完成的真实DeerFlow 2.0首跑- ✅ **知识资产识别**：获取2-4月每周预测数据\\n- ✅ **数据解析与结构化**：整理关键指标对比表\\n- ✅ **知识资产沉淀**：3条记忆已存入LanceDB\\n- ✅ **飞书文档归档**：[https://www.feishu.cn/docx/EIXtdPMvzot6hZxUkmRcZMpanHg](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/EIXtdPMvzot6hZxUkmRcZMpanHg)---已更新到 `MEMORY.md` 并存入 `LanceDB` 长期记忆！🦞\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T09:18:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b523224c92ca0c3c99f6a4e2fd4a\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523223c5d8a8c44810e9c7fe9d3\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"收到晁总！我立即把DeerFlow 2.0的后续发展方向列入开发规划中。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T09:18:08+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b523224c92ca0c3c99f6a4e2fd4a\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523223cf1ca0c31812f3db2bc32\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"收到晁总！我立即把DeerFlow 2.0的后续发展方向列入开发规划中。\\n让我先查看一下现有的规划文档，然后更新进去。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T09:18:08+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b523224c92ca0c3c99f6a4e2fd4a\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b523224c92ca0c3c99f6a4e2fd4a\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"@arkclaw版openclaw 列入你的开发规划中\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T09:17:20+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b53c2b4484cb4c34d09db112a38e\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83\",\n          \"name\": \"arkclaw版openclaw\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53c34eb1ecb8c33d5b07aa01973\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"已同步完成知识资产学习和归档记录📝，后续会持续跟踪DeerFlow 2.0的迭代升级，确保相关资产持续沉淀。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_a94b70746df8dccc\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-03T15:45:11+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100b53c2b07508a4c3f0a474f3e64b5\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMLt26-aTu4HeXkJxeYYDp7O6qJ-wocsFnTFM2S6D0fO-6C_AKG8tzzYBfeIC8kkowp0_mkot92adSPjqewFnHHsLVuXuum_sx0mt0Ro5Olmx\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b523223c0e4a0c2b91922dee0f28","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card>\n✅ **已完成！DeerFlow 2.0开发规划已列入！**---##### 📋 已列入的4大发展方向\n| 方向 | 优先级 | 核心目标 | 预计时间 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| 1️⃣ 自动化 | 🔴 最高 | 每周五自动获取最新预测数据 | 1-2周 |\n| 2️⃣ 智能化 | 🟡 高 | 基于历史数据训练预测模型 | 3-4周 |\n| 3️⃣ 协作化 | 🟢 中 | 多AI角色分工协作 | 4-6周 |\n| 4️⃣ 产品化 | 🔵 长期 | 固化为AI Native产品，推广到32家酒店 | 8-12周 |\n|  |  |  |  |---##### ✅ 已完成的真实DeerFlow 2.0首跑- ✅ **知识资产识别**：获取2-4月每周预测数据\n- ✅ **数据解析与结构化**：整理关键指标对比表\n- ✅ **知识资产沉淀**：3条记忆已存入LanceDB\n- ✅ **飞书文档归档**：[https://www.feishu.cn/docx/EIXtdPMvzot6hZxUkmRcZMpanHg](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/EIXtdPMvzot6hZxUkmRcZMpanHg)---已更新到 `MEMORY.md` 并存入 `LanceDB` 长期记忆！🦞\n</card>","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-04T09:18:09+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b523224c92ca0c3c99f6a4e2fd4a"},{"message_id":"om_x100b523223c5d8a8c44810e9c7fe9d3","msg_type":"post","content":"收到晁总！我立即把DeerFlow 2.0的后续发展方向列入开发规划中。","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-04T09:18:08+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b523224c92ca0c3c99f6a4e2fd4a"},{"message_id":"om_x100b523223cf1ca0c31812f3db2bc32","msg_type":"post","content":"收到晁总！我立即把DeerFlow 2.0的后续发展方向列入开发规划中。\n让我先查看一下现有的规划文档，然后更新进去。","sender":{"id":"cli_a9f1f050f179dbd3","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-04T09:18:08+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b523224c92ca0c3c99f6a4e2fd4a"},{"message_id":"om_x100b523224c92ca0c3c99f6a4e2fd4a","msg_type":"text","content":"@arkclaw版openclaw 列入你的开发规划中","sender":{"id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","sender_type":"user","name":"晁留柱"},"create_time":"2026-04-04T09:17:20+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":true,"reply_to":"om_x100b53c2b4484cb4c34d09db112a38e","mentions":[{"key":"@_user_1","id":"ou_3ccf1eaae932cf5330813ef82cdfba83","name":"arkclaw版openclaw"}]},{"message_id":"om_x100b53c34eb1ecb8c33d5b07aa01973","msg_type":"post","content":"已同步完成知识资产学习和归档记录📝，后续会持续跟踪DeerFlow 2.0的迭代升级，确保相关资产持续沉淀。","sender":{"id":"cli_a94b70746df8dccc","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-03T15:45:11+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false,"reply_to":"om_x100b53c2b07508a4c3f0a474f3e64b5"}],"has_more":true,"page_token":"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMLt26-aTu4HeXkJxeYYDp7O6qJ-wocsFnTFM2S6D0fO-6C_AKG8tzzYBfeIC8kkowp0_mkot92adSPjqewFnHHsLVuXuum_sx0mt0Ro5Olmx"},"isError":f