{"type":"message","id":"5cafaa9a","parentId":"6ede802c","timestamp":"2026-04-07T18:03:25.429Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_tshsixzdr0up_6","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5266f2fbb4a8b26f53830e2c6b1\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-08T00:07:31+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53ca07e90ca0c2b9a7e3973cc96\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-04T00:02:26+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53dd723dc8a0c2ac22f37021a82\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-03T00:05:35+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53e0514298a4b215e006b93689e\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-02T00:04:09+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f9db8a68f4b39cfc8cea4c63b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"张惠的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 海油工程长住\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 店内接待海工长住入住，下载app及点亮神灯，后期还有同事过来办理入住，做好接待\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n📝 🖼️ 图片 [汇报](lark://client/app_profile?appId=cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_be65a652ab913c8f90e6c0ac1ded1fe8\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"张惠\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T16:37:40+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f8b0368d08b4c7c99b4e3755d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"夏美娟的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 中远海运特种运输\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 拜访中远海运特种运输张姐，今天巫总不在单位，与办公室张姐见面聊聊酒店下载APP，客人自己下订单的流程和益处，把做好的下载流程以及相关介绍文件面对面发送。方便更全面的了解，帮忙介绍给客人。\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n📝 🖼️ 图片 [汇报](lark://client/app_profile?appId=cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"夏美娟\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T15:57:35+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f8bf28b4e4b26ebf5a0a21e0b\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"王鑫的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 设计院\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 上门送盖章账单讲解目前酒店神灯服务流程操作并邀请到店体验\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T15:54:06+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53f8dfb218e8c49b0dd0b795a7c\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"李勋的酒店市场销售本地市场及外拓市场拜访日报\\\">\\n**外拓拜访对象:** 拜访中交一航一\\n\\n**外拓主要事宜及取得的成果:** 接待中交一航一审计领导，到店参观客房、餐厅，会务组负责人交代重要性，用餐菜品了解，房间卫生情况！\\n\\n**外拓拜访现场水印拍照照片:** [图片，请在小程序中打开]\\n**其他事项（如认为有必要可填写，如无则写无）:** 无\\n\\n[查看详情]\\n📝 🖼️ 图片 [汇报](lark://client/app_profile?appId=cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c)\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_7473ee6b5d079194d597ca62ce025187\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"赵炳涛\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T15:28:24+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53feaedb40b4b4bb8978488c2f6\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"image\",\n      \"content\": \"[image]\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_33166a97b0d633a706e78ebb69907c80\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"夏美娟\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T13:32:49+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": true,\n      \"updated\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538b49aec8acc35f9cdc65c29a9\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"interactive\",\n      \"content\": \"<card title=\\\"汇报提交统计\\\">\\n[按钮]\\n</card>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"app\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2026-04-01T00:04:06+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    }\n  ],\n  \"has_more\": true,\n  \"page_token\": \"4cXSlmN7uFAnWWU5yfIGMPyg88HCBxC7E4zEGo7nzZU9sMcwQVLPoKGO-_P9Os59432mcZkv4uYc17vMOfmTN-zfirpDP6v4xV33t0HH3EfohberLVYgpYs3i_vXCFD8\"\n}"}],"details":{"messages":[{"message_id":"om_x100b5266f2fbb4a8b26f53830e2c6b1","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"汇报提交统计\">\n[按钮]\n</card>","sender":{"id":"cli_9d0208a7d1bbd10c","sender_type":"app"},"create_time":"2026-04-08T00:07:31+08:00","deleted":false,"updated":false},{"message_id":"om_x100b53ca07e90ca0c2b9a7e3973cc96","msg_type":"interactive","content":"<card title=\"汇报提交统计\">\n[按钮]\n</card>","sender":{"id":"cli_9d0