{"type":"message","id":"6800ab33","parentId":"acfed753","timestamp":"2026-04-07T18:03:25.432Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_tshsixzdr0up_8","toolName":"feishu_im_user_get_messages","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbb30ac6788180f2b3868ef19344\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"<p>@丁立锋 丁总您好，通常代购类：办公用品（文件夹）、电子产品（平板、光盘、硬盘、U盘）、书籍、生活用品（锅碗类）、烟酒茶、办公家俱（椅子）</p>\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2024-11-22T17:26:02+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": true,\n      \"reply_to\": \"om_x100bbb309be549b40f44d02c4b7ca1d\",\n      \"mentions\": [\n        {\n          \"key\": \"@_user_1\",\n          \"id\": \"ou_b44c6cc3725fecd42af0d2a7f76a0af3\",\n          \"name\": \"丁立锋\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbb309be549b40f44d02c4b7ca1d\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content\": \"代购商品的类目会有哪些？\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_b44c6cc3725fecd42af0d2a7f76a0af3\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"丁立锋\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2024-11-22T17:22:26+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbb308b1b02f40f16c58cacc1c39\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n      \"content\": \"![image](img_v3_02gs_813b2084-3017-4571-b0bf-79b25ad3808g)\\n丁总您好，上述业务都是酒店常年合作的协议单位或长租房宾客涉及到的，请您查收审阅。\",\n      \"sender\": {\n        \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n        \"sender_type\": \"user\",\n        \"name\": \"晁留柱\"\n      },\n      \"create_time\": \"2024-11-22T17:18:21+08:00\",\n      \"deleted\": false,\n      \"updated\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"message_id\": \"om_x100bbb3750b0859c0f493136e12cca7\",\n      \"msg_type\": \"text\",\n      \"content